[[File:Raw giant flatfish detail.png|100px|left]]
A '''raw giant flatfish''' is a type of fish that can be caught while [[Dungeoneering]] with level 30 [[Fishing]], giving 63 experience. Raw giant flatfish can be cooked with a [[Cooking]] level of 30 or higher. Cooking raw giant flatfish gives 82 experience and yields a [[giant flatfish]]. Players may accidentally [[burn]] giant flatfish while cooking, yielding a [[burnt giant flatfish]], though the chance to burn a giant flatfish is less likely when cooked on higher tier logs or at a [[range]]. Burning a giant flatfish grants no experience. Raw giant flatfish can be bought from the smuggler for 1400 [[coins]] per fish. 

